<%= @digest.kind == "event" ? "An alert from your assistant" : "Your summary of #{@digest.local_date.iso8601}" %> — <%= @digest.entity.legal_name %>

<% @digest.sections.each do |section| %>
<%= section["title"] %>
<% section["items"].each do |item| %>
- <%= item["text"] %><%= " (#{item['detail']})" if @details && item["detail"].present? %>
<% end %>

<% end %>
Open it: <%= @url %>

Figures and names stay in the application. You choose when you receive this in the summary preferences.
